{"story_id":29930,"updated_at":"2026-10-16T21:22:08","headline_en":"India women beat Zimbabwe by four wickets in first T20 International","headline_hi":"भारत की महिलाओं ने पहले टी20 अंतरराष्ट्रीय मैच में जिम्बाब्वे को चार विकेट से हराया","payload_en":{"story_id":29930,"headline":"India women beat Zimbabwe by four wickets in first T20 International","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":2,"outlets":2},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Aaj Tak","Times of India"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":29930,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-10-16T21:22:08","category":{"primary":["life"],"secondary":["sport-films"]},"places":[],"people":["Zimbabwe","Anushka Sharma","Bharatiya","Deepti Sharma","Nandani Sharma","Niki Prasad","Harmanpreet Kaur","N Shree Charani"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"The Bharatiya women's cricket team won the first T20 International match against Zimbabwe by four wickets on Friday 16 October 2026.","ids":[54089],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"On 16 October 2026, Niki Prasad was making her international career debut.","ids":[54088],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Zimbabwe lost all 18 of their T20Is this year.","ids":[54078],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"On Friday 16 October 2026, Nyasha Gwanzura dismissed Smriti Mandhana, Anushka Sharma, and Shafali Verma, and Michelle Mavunga dismissed Harmanpreet Kaur.","ids":[54067,54068],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"N Shree Charani took one wicket for the Bharatiya team.","ids":[54106],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"On 16 October 2026, India's T20I captain began her first match as full-time captain with a couple of boundaries, and her dismissal triggered a collapse that left India at 19 for 4.","ids":[54069,54070],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Bharatiya team lost four wickets for only 19 runs while chasing a target of 115 runs.","ids":[54090],"cl